@Tasks_QA_BIT_HostAddress = http://localhost:5128

### Crear una tarea
POST {{Tasks_QA_BIT_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Preparar entrega",
  "description": "Revisar los pendientes del sprint",
  "status": "Pendiente",
  "responsible": "Ana",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-31"
}

### Listar con filtros y paginación
GET {{Tasks_QA_BIT_HostAddress}}/api/tasks?status=Pendiente&responsible=Ana&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###
